{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":50.16999816894531,"text":"In a small bay south of the town, there is a spring that was known in antiquity because people believed its water helped the stomach. In 1929, when the Dodecanese were under Italian administration, a young architect designed a whole complex of baths around it— domes, semicircular colonnades, staircases going down to the sea. The floors are laid with black and white pebbles gathered from the beaches and set one at a time into patterns. The baths closed in the 1960s and were abandoned for more than 40 years, with weeds coming up through the buildings. They were restored and reopened in 2007. Today, nobody drinks the water, but everybody swims in the bay, and the pebble floors are walked on again every summer.","words":[{"word":"In","start":0,"end":0.4399999976158142},{"word":"a","start":0.4399999976158142,"end":0.6600000262260437},{"word":"small","start":0.6600000262260437,"end":0.9800000190734863},{"word":"bay","start":0.9800000190734863,"end":1.3200000524520874},{"word":"south","start":1.3200000524520874,"end":1.7400000095367432},{"word":"of","start":1.7400000095367432,"end":1.9199999570846558},{"word":"the","start":1.9199999570846558,"end":2.059999942779541},{"word":"town","start":2.059999942779541,"end":2.380000114440918},{"word":"there","start":2.940000057220459,"end":3},{"word":"is","start":3,"end":3.180000066757202},{"word":"a","start":3.180000066757202,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"spring","start":3.680000066757202,"end":3.680000066757202},{"word":"that","start":3.680000066757202,"end":3.9600000381469727},{"word":"was","start":3.9600000381469727,"end":4.199999809265137},{"word":"known","start":4.199999809265137,"end":4.420000076293945},{"word":"in","start":4.420000076293945,"end":4.78000020980835},{"word":"antiquity","start":4.78000020980835,"end":5.21999979019165},{"word":"because","start":5.21999979019165,"end":5.900000095367432},{"word":"people","start":5.900000095367432,"end